  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_01",
      "hash": "fb4676393b4acf3b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「啊！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]ー！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_02",
      "hash": "fb4677393b4ad0ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也想\\n去見識一下[VAR COLOR(0006)]寶可夢聯盟[VAR COLOR(0000)]嗎？\\c\\n那裡可是能跟訓練家之中\\n最強的[VAR COLOR(0006)]四天王[VAR COLOR(0000)]對戰的地方！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_03",
      "hash": "fb4678393b4ad2a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "雖然我真的很想\\n親眼見見四天王……\\c\\n但他們說要有寶可夢道館的\\n徽章才行，所以不讓我過去！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_04",
      "hash": "fb4679393b4ad454",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "算了，看來就只能腳踏實地\\n慢慢讓自己變強了。\\c\\n好！[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n我們就腳踏實地來對戰一場吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_05",
      "hash": "fb467a393b4ad607",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……這樣算是\\n在幫[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳變得更強吧。\\r\\n算了，這樣也好！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_06",
      "hash": "fb467b393b4ad7ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳跟我都要好好加油，\\n我們總有一天要一起走進寶可夢聯盟！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_field_r022",
